# VideoRisk v1.0 — Complete Pricing Cards, Registration Journey, Account Billing UI & Credit-Aware Upgrade Flow

## Objective

Inspect, implement, and verify a complete customer-facing pricing and membership experience for VideoRisk v1.0.

The objective is to make all five pricing options easy to understand, improve the registration-to-purchase journey, and provide clear account and billing information.

This is a production-oriented implementation task, not a UI-only redesign.

**Repository:** https://github.com/Kunnapatara/videorisk-v1.0

**Inspected baseline:** `main` at commit `b4d1c44069d55f4af8988484b01c5f9b800668d9`

Before changing any code, inspect the latest repository state and identify any changes made after this baseline.

